---
// Component: ProcessSteps.astro
---
<!-- 8. PROCESS: HOW CCTV INSTALLATION WORKS -->
<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/50 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800/50 shadow-2xs">
        Streamlined 4-Step Process
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight font-display">
        How Our Security Installation Works
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        From your initial enquiry to mobile handover: transparent, prompt, and zero mess left behind.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-red-500 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-red-600/25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            1
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 font-display">Property Consultation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Tell us about your property layout, blind spots, and security goals. We review roof cavity access and provide a firm, itemized quote.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>✓ 100% Free & No-Obligation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-800 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 font-display">Hidden Cat6 Cabling</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Our ACMA-licensed cabler feeds 100% pure copper Cat6 cabling inside wall cavities and roof voids. Zero ugly dangling wires.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>✓ ACMA Rules Compliant</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-800 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 font-display">Mounting & Precision Setup</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Cameras are weatherproofed and aimed to eliminate blind spots. NVR recorder and firewall are secured on your private subnet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>✓ Zero Monthly Fees</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-red-500 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-red-600/25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            4
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 font-display">Phone App & Handover</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We set up the live viewing app on all your family or staff phones, calibrate AI human/vehicle alerts, and provide full training.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>✓ Ready on iOS & Android</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
